#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/routes/_home/-sections/faq.tsx
msgid "home.faq.atsText"
msgstr "Yes. HeadCV exports clean, text-based PDFs with embedded fonts and clear structure so applicant tracking systems can read your resume, including two-column templates. For very old systems, a one-column layout is the safest choice. Clear headings, relevant keywords, and impact-focused bullet points still matter most."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/routes/_home/-sections/faq.tsx
msgid "home.faq.versionsText"
msgstr "Yes. One resume is free to edit and download without limits. Upgrade to a paid plan to save multiple versions at the same time for different roles or languages. If you return to the free plan, your first resume remains editable and downloadable while additional versions stay saved but locked."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/routes/_home/-sections/faq.tsx
msgid "home.faq.importText"
msgstr "Yes. Upload a PDF or Microsoft Word document and HeadCV will import its content into a clean, editable, ATS-friendly layout so you can start faster."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/routes/_home/-sections/faq.tsx
msgid "home.faq.languagesText"
msgstr "Yes. You can write your resume in multiple languages and customize section labels, date formats, and page size. HeadCV supports right-to-left layouts for languages such as Arabic and Hebrew. Upgrading lets you save and manage a separate resume version for each language."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/routes/_home/-sections/faq.tsx
msgid "home.faq.freeText"
msgstr "Yes. Your first resume is free forever, with unlimited watermark-free PDF downloads, access to every template, and full layout and design control. No trial or credit card is required. You only pay for optional extras such as saving multiple resume versions or using AI writing assistance."

